  "s04": {
    "duration": 29.016,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "有符号数用补码，它和纯二进制只差一个地方。",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 43850963
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "最高位的权重，不是正的一百二十八。",
        "offset": 44350963,
        "duration": 30769231
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "而是负的一百二十八。",
        "offset": 75120195,
        "duration": 18990385
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "把这个负号刻进脑子里，补码就通了。",
        "offset": 94110580,
        "duration": 29447116
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "还是那串位，一后面七个零，代表负一百二十八。",
        "offset": 123557696,
        "duration": 43028847
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "加上最低位的一，就是负一百二十七。",
        "offset": 166586544,
        "duration": 31250001
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "所以八位补码的范围，是负一百二十八到正一百二十七。",
        "offset": 197836545,
        "duration": 47355770
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "负数比正数多一个，因为正零和负零合并了。",
        "offset": 245192316,
        "duration": 44591347
      }
    ],
