  "s06": {
    "duration": 34.128,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "对比一下原码：最高位符号位，剩下是绝对值。",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 44812501
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "正二十五和负二十五，只差最高位。",
        "offset": 45312501,
        "duration": 33774039
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "原码直观，但有两个硬伤。",
        "offset": 79086541,
        "duration": 28365385
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "第一，零有两种编码，正零和负零，浪费一个。",
        "offset": 107451927,
        "duration": 47596155
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "第二，做加法要先比大小再决定谁减谁，硬件更复杂。",
        "offset": 155048082,
        "duration": 55288463
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "所以现代机器里，整数只用补码。",
        "offset": 210336546,
        "duration": 36658655
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "再补一个概念：把补码的符号位取反，得到移码。",
        "offset": 246995201,
        "duration": 41105770
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "移码把大小顺序变成无符号比较，专门用来存阶码。",
        "offset": 288100972,
        "duration": 52644232
      }
    ],
